{"id":"msg_m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_dazzlingpearl","label":"Dazzling Pearl · Group"},"label":"1. Hey there, Teacher!","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_dazzlingpearl_02","speakers":{"naga":"Naga","tia":"Tia"},"icons":{"naga":"si_c450_00_s","tia":"si_c451_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_1","text":"Hey there, Teacher!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_2","text":"Sorry to bother you, but here's a question.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_3","text":"Can we talk about it for a while on Bla?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_4","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_5","text":"Great♥","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_6","text":"My question is...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_7","text":"How's your memory?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_8","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_8","text":"Pretty good.","jump":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_10"},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_9","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_9","text":"Not so good.","jump":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_11"},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_10","text":"Really? I suppose that makes sense for you, hehe♥","jump":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_12"},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_11","text":"Then that makes two of us, ha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_12","text":"What do you do","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_13","text":"when you've got to","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_14","text":"remember something","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_15","text":"really important?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_16","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_16","text":"Take notes.","jump":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_18"},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_17","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_17","text":"Set an alarm.","jump":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_18"},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_18","text":"You see, Tia?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_19","text":"Teacher uses the exact same method.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_20","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_21","text":"What's the matter?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_22","text":"Tia is constantly forgetting things.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_23","text":"Especially things that she needs to prepare beforehand, including her homework.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_24","text":"So I suggested she start taking notes or setting an alarm clock.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_25","text":"Something. Anything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_26","text":"But she insists that nothing will make a difference.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_27","text":"I'm telling you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_28","text":"none of those methods will be any help for me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_29","text":"Why's that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_30","text":"Because","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_31","text":"even if I take notes,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_32","text":"I'd eventually just end up","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_33","text":"forgetting that I'd taken notes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_34","text":"As for alarm clocks,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_35","text":"I'd forget why I set the alarm in the first place.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_36","text":"So I've still got to depend on Naga to remind me about stuff♥","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_37","text":"See, now that doesn't make any sense to me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_38","text":"You never forget anything about the lessons in class.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_39","text":"Because those are what really matter.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_40","text":"So how you dress yourself doesn't matter?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_41","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_42","text":"I guess I've just gotten used to you preparing all that for me, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_43","text":"Give me a break!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_44","text":"Are you telling me I've got to forever be responsible for your own wardrobe?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_45","text":"Yep!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_46","text":"I'm never worried about forgetting stuff,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_47","text":"because I know you'll always be there to bring me a spare♥","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_48","text":"When you think about it, Naga is your notes and alarm clock.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_49","text":"Hmm,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_50","text":"I never thought about it that way, but I guess you're right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_51","text":"I'd be helpless without you, Naga♥","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_52","text":"So that's it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_53","text":"I just...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_01_54","text":"Ugh, fine.","jump":null}],"chat":true}